 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Moon Dregs — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>At 6th level, your cursed energy has become more corrosive and noxious, further seeping into <em>Moon Dregs</em>. When you use <em>Poisonous Cursed Energy</em>, a creature must make a Constitution saving throw or be poisoned for 1 minute. They can repeat the saving throw at the end of their turns, ending the effect on a success. While poisoned in this way, the target has a temporary level of exhaustion.<br />\n<em>Moon Dregs</em> can now make two attacks when it takes the attack action and can grant a creature three quarters cover while occupying a creature’s space, and full cover at 11th level.</p>",
